[91.861706,"o","\n"]
[91.861739,"o","    BusyBox is a multi-call binary that combines many common Unix\n"]
[91.861769,"o","    utilities into a single executable.  Most people will create a\n"]
[91.861786,"o","    link to busybox for each function they wish to use and BusyBox\n"]
[91.861803,"o","    will act like whatever it was invoked as.\n"]
[91.861819,"o","\n"]
[91.861836,"o","Currently defined functions:\n"]
[91.861852,"o","    [, [[, adjtimex, ar, arp, arping, ash, awk, basename, blockdev, brctl,\n"]
